(7429721, 1174169, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good panoramic, but is it really close up?</td>', 'Good panoramic, but is it really close up?', '2016-01-18 14:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429722, 1174138, 114225, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t appear to meet the challenge at all.</td>', 'Doesn''t appear to meet the challenge at all.', '2016-01-18 14:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429724, 1174216, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W. Could be panorama, or maybe just a crop. But is it really close up?</td>', 'Nice B&W. Could be panorama, or maybe just a crop. But is it really close up?', '2016-01-18 14:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429725, 1174219, 114225, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem close up to anything.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem close up to anything.', '2016-01-18 14:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429726, 1174094, 114225, '<td valign="top">Appears just like a shot. Doesn''t appear panoramic. Doesn''t appear close up.</td>', 'Appears just like a shot. Doesn''t appear panoramic. Doesn''t appear close up.', '2016-01-18 14:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429727, 1174079, 114225, '<td valign="top">Appears just like a shot. Doesn''t appear panoramic. Doesn''t appear close up.</td>', 'Appears just like a shot. Doesn''t appear panoramic. Doesn''t appear close up.', '2016-01-18 14:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429728, 1174091, 114225, '<td valign="top">It could be a panoramic if he is super good at staying still. But it''s not really close up.</td>', 'It could be a panoramic if he is super good at staying still. But it''s not really close up.', '2016-01-18 14:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429729, 1174190, 114225, '<td valign="top">Seems more like it was shot with a super wide lens instead of being a panoramic.</td>', 'Seems more like it was shot with a super wide lens instead of being a panoramic.', '2016-01-18 14:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429734, 1174206, 51001, '<td valign="top">No motion, processing problems.  IMO, should have made the baby''s head correct &amp; put the gaps (if any) in the distance.  "stitch" software nowadays is so good that you can''t distinguish it from a true wide-angle lens (that is, if the software is used correctly).</td>', 'No motion, processing problems.  IMO, should have made the baby''s head correct & put the gaps (if any) in the distance.  "stitch" software nowadays is so good that you can''t distinguish it from a true wide-angle lens (that is, if the software is used correctly).', '2016-01-18 14:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429735, 1174079, 51001, '<td valign="top">How does this meet the challenge?</td>', 'How does this meet the challenge?', '2016-01-18 14:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429737, 1174208, 51001, '<td valign="top">IMO, the idea of the challenge is a much wider DOF so you can actually make out the background.</td>', 'IMO, the idea of the challenge is a much wider DOF so you can actually make out the background.', '2016-01-18 14:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429740, 1174190, 51001, '<td valign="top">Nice, one of the few I''ve seen (so far) that in any way meets the spirit of the challenge.<br/> <br/>- Need to get control of those highlights!  (e.g., around the Alabama flag).<br/>- May also have "clipped" your black in the jet engine exhaust.</td>', 'Nice, one of the few I''ve seen (so far) that in any way meets the spirit of the challenge. - Need to get control of those highlights!  (e.g., around the Alabama flag).- May also have "clipped" your black in the jet engine exhaust.', '2016-01-18 14:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7429879, 1174215, 15511, '<td valign="top">Brilliant interpretation!</td>', 'Brilliant interpretation!', '2016-01-19 00:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430025, 1174138, 96751, '<td valign="top">I think you could have cropped this to the bottom of the vase and made it look more "panoramic". But I love how the sun hits the "face"</td>', 'I think you could have cropped this to the bottom of the vase and made it look more "panoramic". But I love how the sun hits the "face"', '2016-01-19 18:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430026, 1174206, 96751, '<td valign="top">Bizarre and engaging.</td>', 'Bizarre and engaging.', '2016-01-19 19:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430028, 1174216, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ha! Looks like there''s a cat in the microwave</td>', 'Ha! Looks like there''s a cat in the microwave', '2016-01-19 19:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430035, 1174190, 181814, '<td valign="top">I can see a few places where the stitching is a bit off, and I think the sun has caused parts of the photo to be under exposed, I am okay with the composition and focus.</td>', 'I can see a few places where the stitching is a bit off, and I think the sun has caused parts of the photo to be under exposed, I am okay with the composition and focus.', '2016-01-19 20:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430036, 1174206, 181814, '<td valign="top">I think this would be much better if the child were in focus and not cut into pieces by what I assume was the stitching together of the frames.I think if you only took two or three frames keeping the child completely in one of them it wold have worked out.</td>', 'I think this would be much better if the child were in focus and not cut into pieces by what I assume was the stitching together of the frames.I think if you only took two or three frames keeping the child completely in one of them it wold have worked out.', '2016-01-19 20:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430038, 1174115, 181814, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouette nature of this photograph and the colors are nice, I think I can see a few places where you stitched it together but not totally sure which is a good thing.Good luck.</td>', 'I like the silhouette nature of this photograph and the colors are nice, I think I can see a few places where you stitched it together but not totally sure which is a good thing.Good luck.', '2016-01-19 20:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430041, 1174177, 181814, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph, and good job stitching it together.</td>', 'Very nice photograph, and good job stitching it together.', '2016-01-19 20:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430042, 1174111, 181814, '<td valign="top">Very nice arrangement.</td>', 'Very nice arrangement.', '2016-01-19 20:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430043, 1174138, 181814, '<td valign="top">I think this could be much better if it were in focus and if parts of it weren''t under exposed.I also think the composition would be better if the foreground statue were not cutoff on the top and bottom.</td>', 'I think this could be much better if it were in focus and if parts of it weren''t under exposed.I also think the composition would be better if the foreground statue were not cutoff on the top and bottom.', '2016-01-19 20:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430045, 1174153, 181814, '<td valign="top">I think the subject matter is okay but the fact that it is out of focus and the highlights are blown-out did it a disservice in my opinion.</td>', 'I think the subject matter is okay but the fact that it is out of focus and the highlights are blown-out did it a disservice in my opinion.', '2016-01-19 20:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430046, 1174216, 181814, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, focus and exposure but I can see where the stitching was does very easily especially on the left and right side of the range/stove.</td>', 'I like the composition, focus and exposure but I can see where the stitching was does very easily especially on the left and right side of the range/stove.', '2016-01-19 20:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430048, 1173913, 181814, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the feather but i think you took to many frames and did not keep the axis level as you took them causing things to be out of focus and out of alignment after stitching them together. I think the color cast on the bottom of the feather is a little distracting also.</td>', 'I like the idea of the feather but i think you took to many frames and did not keep the axis level as you took them causing things to be out of focus and out of alignment after stitching them together. I think the color cast on the bottom of the feather is a little distracting also.', '2016-01-19 20:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430051, 1174091, 181814, '<td valign="top">I like the pose/serious look on the mans face sitting in the chair but I wish the left side of his face had a little more exposure. I can also detect some of your stitch points. The focus is nice and I would probably like it better if the black area on the left were cropped out. I do like the color toning.</td>', 'I like the pose/serious look on the mans face sitting in the chair but I wish the left side of his face had a little more exposure. I can also detect some of your stitch points. The focus is nice and I would probably like it better if the black area on the left were cropped out. I do like the color toning.', '2016-01-19 20:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430200, 1174121, 181623, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail.</td>', 'Beautiful detail.', '2016-01-20 11:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430203, 1174169, 181623, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Like you''re telling a story. I can''t stop looking at this photo!</td>', 'Interesting. Like you''re telling a story. I can''t stop looking at this photo!', '2016-01-20 11:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430207, 1173748, 181623, '<td valign="top">Good composition, use of line, and negative space.</td>', 'Good composition, use of line, and negative space.', '2016-01-20 11:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430208, 1174177, 181623, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2016-01-20 11:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
