(7430220, 1174120, 181623, '<td valign="top">Good idea. I like the tone and detail.</td>', 'Good idea. I like the tone and detail.', '2016-01-20 11:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430222, 1174091, 181623, '<td valign="top">Good portrait and use of light.</td>', 'Good portrait and use of light.', '2016-01-20 11:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430228, 1174219, 181623, '<td valign="top">I like the mood created. Like we''re being treated to glimpses of different stories.</td>', 'I like the mood created. Like we''re being treated to glimpses of different stories.', '2016-01-20 11:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430230, 1174115, 181623, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.</td>', 'I like the composition.', '2016-01-20 11:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430396, 1174116, 86447, '<td valign="top">I think this would go over better with the voters with something to show that they''re... tiny.<br/> <br/>I love it, though.</td>', 'I think this would go over better with the voters with something to show that they''re... tiny. I love it, though.', '2016-01-20 21:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430397, 1174152, 86447, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.   I love the image.  I think, though... that there could be more details... sharp ones... in the yellow and purple images.   <br/>  The greens in the middle one... are really soft.<br/> <br/>Yet... I want you to remember that I said... "I love the image"... because... <br/> <br/>I do.  :D</td>', 'Wonderful.   I love the image.  I think, though... that there could be more details... sharp ones... in the yellow and purple images.     The greens in the middle one... are really soft. Yet... I want you to remember that I said... "I love the image"... because...  I do.  :D', '2016-01-20 21:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430398, 1174153, 86447, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a perfect subject for this challenge topic!  <br/> <br/>I wish... though... that the grapes were fresh and clean... with no age spots.<br/> <br/>But... I with that about myself, too.  *sigh*</td>', 'Wow!  What a perfect subject for this challenge topic!   I wish... though... that the grapes were fresh and clean... with no age spots. But... I with that about myself, too.  *sigh*', '2016-01-20 21:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430399, 1174111, 86447, '<td valign="top">Gee, Golly, Wow.<br/> <br/>Lovely image... <br/> <br/>Best in class for a composition in the topic.<br/> <br/>Could show more detail to win Best in Show.  :D</td>', 'Gee, Golly, Wow. Lovely image...  Best in class for a composition in the topic. Could show more detail to win Best in Show.  :D', '2016-01-20 21:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430400, 1174215, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love how you''ve shown the "shots" in the capture.  I''m not sure that''s legal... to have extra space in the image... that''s not images... but I love how you''ve overlapped them... to show us your steps.<br/> <br/>It makes the image so much more fun!!</td>', 'I love how you''ve shown the "shots" in the capture.  I''m not sure that''s legal... to have extra space in the image... that''s not images... but I love how you''ve overlapped them... to show us your steps. It makes the image so much more fun!!', '2016-01-20 21:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430401, 1174169, 86447, '<td valign="top">Ha!  I love this whole... wide angle life you''ve shown us!  Thanks!</td>', 'Ha!  I love this whole... wide angle life you''ve shown us!  Thanks!', '2016-01-20 21:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7430402, 1174115, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love this image!   <br/> <br/>BUT... as a "panorama"... I think voters would believe it''s multiple images stitched together more easily if... your crop were less full on the height size.<br/> <br/>If it''s really adhering to the challenge description and... you actually DID stitch together multiple images to make this, then... well...<br/> <br/>I bow to your merging finesse!   Well done!</td>', 'I love this image!    BUT... as a "panorama"... I think voters would believe it''s multiple images stitched together more easily if... your crop were less full on the height size. If it''s really adhering to the challenge description and... you actually DID stitch together multiple images to make this, then... well... I bow to your merging finesse!   Well done!', '2016-01-20 21:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
